<title>UK: ABN AMRO sets 100 mln rand three-year bond.</title>
<headline>ABN AMRO sets 100 mln rand three-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager ABN AMRO Hoare Govett.</p>
<p> BORROWER   ABN AMRO BANK</p>
<p> AMT    100 MLN RAND  COUPON     15.0 PCT  MATURITY    07.MAR.00</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  100.90    PAY DATE    07.MAR.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.375     REOFFER    99.90     SPREAD	=</p>
<p> MOODY	AA1	 LISTING    AMST	PAY FREQ    =</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  AA	  DENOMS (K)1-5-50 SALE LIMITS US/UK/NETH/ZA</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.375 PCT SELL CONC  1.0 PCT</p>
<p> NOTES	ISSUED OFF THE EMTN PROGRAMME</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
